       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CLAY-PLAY-EXTENDED.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-EXTENDED-CLAY-PROOFS.
           05  WS-MORPH-MOLD-INVAR-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SPATIAL-TOPOLOGY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MOMENTUM-PRESERVE-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PREINVENTIVE-BOUND-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-EXTENDED-CLAY-SEAL-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-EXTENDED-CLAY-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-EXT-CLAY-PROVEN      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-EXT-CLAY-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-MORPH-AND-SPATIAL.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-MOMENTUM-AND-BOUNDS.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-EXTENDED-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-MORPH-AND-SPATIAL.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MORPH-MOLD-INVAR-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SPATIAL-TOPOLOGY-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-MOMENTUM-AND-BOUNDS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MOMENTUM-PRESERVE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PREINVENTIVE-BOUND-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-EXTENDED-PROOFS.
           IF WS-MORPH-MOLD-INVAR-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SPATIAL-TOPOLOGY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-MOMENTUM-PRESERVE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PREINVENTIVE-BOUND-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-EXTENDED-CLAY-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-EXT-CLAY-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-EXT-CLAY-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-EXT-CLAY-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-EXT-CLAY-CODE.
